      "for_authoritative_voices_on_maine_wate": " Untuk suara berwibawa tentang kerja daerah aliran sungai Maine, konsultasikan Penobscot Nation Cultural and Historic Preservation Department, Wabanaki Public Health and Wellness, Atlantic Salmon Federation, Maine Coast Heritage Trust, Maine Audubon, Maine Soil and Water Conservation Districts, dan Maine Department of Environmental Protection.",
