      "manipulatives_montessori_golden_beads_": "Alat peraga: Montessori (Manik Emas), Cuisenaire (1952), Gattegno (Papan Geometri), Matematika Singapura (Ikatan Bilangan).",
      "standards_common_core_state_standards_": "Standar: Common Core State Standards untuk Matematika, TK-kelas 7.",
