      "little_brown_bat_big_brown_bat_norther": "Little brown bat, Big brown bat, Northern long-eared bat (endangered), Eastern small-footed bat, Tri-colored bat, Silver-haired bat, Hoary bat, Red bat. The cave-hibernating species (first 4) are most affected by white-nose syndrome.",
