      "disable_cost_of_speed_auto_run_for_50_": "Disable Cost of Speed. Auto-Run for 50 generations. Speeds hit the simulation cap (1.0) and stay there. In nature, real costs (energy, predation visibility, joint stress) prevent this — which is why cheetahs aren't infinitely fast.",
      "discovery_timeline": "Discovery Timeline",
